  "winnow has no enter/exit transition clips (the brief lists only the winnow loop). Its first key differs from the r002 idle pose by up to 82.5 deg (arm joints) and 0.02 m (pelvis); the game should cross-fade (~0.3-0.5 s) and show the tray at the switch. thresh_enter/thresh_exit do start/end exactly on r002 idle.",
  "Extra floor anchors strike_target, tray_rest and stick_rest and extra stick anchor tip were added for placement/contact checks; the five required floor anchors are present.",
  "The stick is held in the right hand from the first key of thresh_enter (idle pose, stick hanging forward-down, >= 0.39 m above the floor): the game shows the stick for the whole enter/thresh/exit sequence.",
  "At the deepest strike the stick tip is 1.65 mm above the clean floor plateau but 1.74 mm into the low chaff-litter patch of the strewn floor (litter apex ~4 mm above the plateau) - reads as the tip pressing into chaff.",
